{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026Cbw5T01vmn1793590958.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>有分析預計，恒指要突破23,600點，才能顯示資金有信心入市。</p><p></p><p>華富建業證券投資策略聯席總監阮子曦說：「暫時恒生指數始終經歷之前兩個星期的跌幅，初步見到在22,800點是企穩的，但人心都是虛怯。大家在買賣的方向上來說，叫做初步企穩。所以我們要見到恒生指數，初步突破之前兩星期的裂口，大概23,600點這個水平。補了裂口才顯示部分資金有信心入市，大家才會跟。」</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-02T05:00:13.152431+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":179,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-02T03:37:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-02T06:38:55.789712+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-02T04:58:06.015161+00:00","content_hash":"05cc803874d0b00114ba6af584582b90187d8b49421003b801c3327b71746898","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-02T05:00:13.152431+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}